_refine_special_details
;
Methylammonium ions are rotationally disordered at room temperature.
They were modeled with 6 different orientations aligned along the cell
axes to show the cubic symmetry and refined isotropically. 
The C-N bond length was fixed using DFIX at 1.5 A. 
Hydrogens were omitted due to the disorder.
1. Shared sites
{C1, N1}
2. Restrained distances
 N1_$11-C1_$7
 1.5 with sigma of 0.02
 C1_$11-N1_$7
 1.5 with sigma of 0.02
 C1_$19-N1
 1.5 with sigma of 0.02
 N1_$19-C1
 1.5 with sigma of 0.02
3. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
Uiso(C1) = Uiso(N1)
4. Others
 Fixed Sof: C1(0.04167) N1(0.04167)
;
